vulkan-perf

This project reimplements Minecraft 26.3 performance features inspired by
public Fabric mods. Upstream source was used only as reference (GitHub tags
first). No upstream classes were pasted or shaded.

Reference projects and licenses (see each project's repository for full terms):

- Lithium — CaffeineMC — LGPL-3.0
- Concurrent Chunk Management Engine (C2ME) — RelativityMC / ishland — MIT
  (C2ME OpenCL module is ARR and was not used)
